### List devices (optional filters: ownerUserId, appId, isActive, limit, offset)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices?limit=50&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a single device
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a device
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "name": "Living room pot",
  "appId": null,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Update a device (full replace)
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Renamed pot",
  "isActive": false,
  "appId": null
}

###

### Delete a device
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001

###

### List telemetry for a device over a period
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001/telemetry/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "to": "2026-01-02T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### Last 24 hours (from/to omitted), capped to 500 rows
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/11111111-1111-4111-8111-000000000001/telemetry/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "limit": 500
}

###
